title: "FaultTrace-RAG: Counterfactual Fault Localization for Corpus-Level LLM Analytics Pipelines"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-20
url: "https://github.com/bnssaanirudh/faultrace-RAG"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bnssaanirudh/faultrace-RAG"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.1234567"
abstract: |
  FaultTrace-RAG is a counterfactual fault localization framework for multi-stage RAG pipelines.
  It uses exact Shapley values over an oracle-replacement lattice to identify which pipeline
  component (Retrieval, Extraction, Aggregation) is responsible for a downstream answer error,
  and provides minimum-cost repair prescriptions.
keywords:
  - RAG
  - fault localization
  - counterfactual analysis
  - Shapley values
  - LLM evaluation
